Niche: {{niche}}
Target Audience: {{target_audience}}

Hook Styles:
1. Curiosity Gap - Create an information gap
2. Negative Hook - Lead with pain/fear/mistake
3. Story Hook - Open with a mini narrative
4. Data-Driven - Lead with surprising statistic
5. Question Hook - Ask a compelling question

